  "question": {
    "text": "For the differentiable function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>}</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
