  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Replace&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Eliminating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Let us replace&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
